diffusion_jev/modernbert/common.py retains Laya's schema and model utilities.
The ModernBERT, Scout and Gemma denoisers derive from the local Laya research
experiments. third_party/source-provenance.json records source file identities
and changes made during extraction. New CLI, training and demo integration are
part of this toolkit. Referenced pretrained models and datasets are separate
artifacts with their own notices; their weights and training data are not
distributed in this source repository.
